    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan Northwest are delighted to bring this beautiful family home to market. The property has been meticulously maintained and beautifully decorated by its current owners. Located within a quiet cul-de-sac, within walking distance of the town centre, Sligo University Hospital, Abbotts, ATU, Ballinode College, and several primary and secondary schools, the property presents an ideal opportunity as a family home or a solid rental investment.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property boasts a 2-car driveway to the front and a large back garden with a polytunnel and a large steel garden shed (both included in the sale). A side entrance exists to allow easy access to the back garden.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property is well maintained and decorated to a high standard. All three bedrooms accommodate double beds, and the master bedroom has a fully tiled ensuite. Downstairs, the property is bright and airy with double windows to the front and rear of the property, allowing light to flood in. There is ample storage via integrated units under the stairs and in the kitchen.  \r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised and strictly through the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
